{"text": " I think technology in and of itself, you cannot say it's good or bad. I think you have to look at technology neutrally. I think what we do with technology, you can jump in now. It's a grease. I'm so sorry. But technology is never neutral because it's not God-given. We designed it. And we designed it to do something. I agree. So for example, it would never occur to you to cook with a gun. It's not made for land. It's made to threaten or kill. And there might be a function in that, but it's not neutral. And when you design AI to extract all value, without consent, to surveil on a mass scale, that is not neutral. And every surveillance tool is not neutral. Surveillance is made to control. And we're social beings. So what do we control? We control other human beings. I agree.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.0, "text": " I think technology in and of itself, you cannot say it's good or bad.", "tokens": [50364, 286, 519, 2899, 294, 293, 295, 2564, 11, 291, 2644, 584, 309, 311, 665, 420, 1578, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1908974025560462, "compression_ratio": 1.7315175097276265, "no_speech_prob": 0.20378968119621277}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.0, "end": 8.0, "text": " I think you have to look at technology neutrally.", "tokens": [50564, 286, 519, 291, 362, 281, 574, 412, 2899, 39913, 379, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1908974025560462, "compression_ratio": 1.7315175097276265, "no_speech_prob": 0.20378968119621277}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 8.0, "end": 12.0, "text": " I think what we do with technology, you can jump in now.", "tokens": [50764, 286, 519, 437, 321, 360, 365, 2899, 11, 291, 393, 3012, 294, 586, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1908974025560462, "compression_ratio": 1.7315175097276265, "no_speech_prob": 0.20378968119621277}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 12.0, "end": 14.0, "text": " It's a grease.", "tokens": [50964, 467, 311, 257, 24867, 13, 51064], "temp